#=============== ACCOUNTS ENDPOINTS ==================

# api call for creating admin user
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/admin-register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"admin0",
    "email":"admin0@gmail.com",
    "password":"Password@123",
    "phone":1234567892
}

